{"3427970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Session with Dr. Liebnitz", "steam_appid": 3427970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>ABOUT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Session with Dr. Liebnitz is a single-player exploration game taking place in the mind of the playable character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427970/extras/6bd560acbc8705997e3eef26a4a399be.poster.avif?t=1775231406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427970/extras/6bd560acbc8705997e3eef26a4a399be.webm?t=1775231406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427970/extras/6bd560acbc8705997e3eef26a4a399be.mp4?t=1775231406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><span class=\"bb_strike\">EXPLORE</span> // CURE the Mind</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as The Character. You will be wandering through the Character's mind, trying to cure it from fear, depression, anger and many more deep, troubling conditions. This is only possible due to the extravagant techniques of one Dr. Liebnitz, who will be with you every step of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427970/extras/cad3ff505c181fdadf09813e37b91368.poster.avif?t=1775231406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427970/extras/cad3ff505c181fdadf09813e37b91368.webm?t=1775231406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427970/extras/cad3ff505c181fdadf09813e37b91368.mp4?t=1775231406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>DIVE Deep</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dark, hidden secrets of the character's mind and free them from their pain. And who knows, perhaps you shall discover some of your own secrets in this poor Character's mind...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Developed by KS-XIII-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >           -Aleexar-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Voice by Alexander J. Pierce-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><i>Disclaimer: This is a game. This game should not be used as a substitute for any medical or psychological treatment. If you do require any assistance, please make sure to contact real, licensed physicians. Dr. Liebnitz is just a fictional character.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>ABOUT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Session with Dr. Liebnitz is a single-player exploration game taking place in the mind of the playable character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427970/extras/6bd560acbc8705997e3eef26a4a399be.poster.avif?t=1775231406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427970/extras/6bd560acbc8705997e3eef26a4a399be.webm?t=1775231406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427970/extras/6bd560acbc8705997e3eef26a4a399be.mp4?t=1775231406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s